# Convention: every external repo studied here is added as a git submodule
# (see README.md). The submodule machinery tracks the path + commit pointer,
# so we don't need a directory-level ignore rule.
#
# This file is kept (mostly empty) so the convention has an obvious place to
# evolve if we later need to ignore generated artifacts produced under a
# submodule's working tree (e.g., build outputs we don't want in the parent
# diff).
